warm-hearted:
中：a. 热烈的, 热心的, 富有同情心的, 热情的
英：a. Having strong affection; cordial; sincere; hearty;
   sympathetic.

wealthiness:
中：n. wealthy的变形
英：n. The quality or state of being wealthy, or rich;
   richness; opulence.

welcomeness:
中：n. welcome的变形
英：n. The quality or state of being welcome; gratefulness;
   agreeableness; kind reception.

whimsicalness:
中：n. whimsical的变形
英：n. The quality or state of being whimsical;
   freakishness; whimsical disposition.

whisperingly:
中：adv. whispering的变形
英：adv. In a whisper, or low voice; in a whispering manner;
   with whispers.

wofully:
中：adv. woful的变形
英：adv. In a woeful manner; sorrowfully; mournfully; miserably;
   dolefully.

wofulness:
中：n. woful的变形
英：n. The quality or state of being woeful; misery;
   wretchedness.

woundless:
中：a. 没有受伤的
英：a. Free from wound or hurt; exempt from being wounded;
   invulnerable.
